cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these policies, please cite the paper they implement (below). To cite
  the source at a reproducible point, use the anchor tag v0.1.0-rc.1.
title: "Agent Decoy Policies"
abstract: >-
  MuleSoft Flex/Omni Gateway custom policies (PDK, Rust to WebAssembly) implementing
  three cyber-deception primitives over agent and Model Context Protocol message
  bodies at a gateway enforcement point: a bidirectional honeytoken tripwire, a
  decoy-tool sentinel, and a breadcrumb lure, with an opt-in coordinator for
  deployments running more than one on the same exchange. Reference implementation
  for the paper below. Not a compliance certification and not production-certified.
